; operata-live.workspace.udon — scenario-corpus edition
; A live Operata workspace: data conforming to operata.domain.udon.
; This is the file the day-in-the-life agents mutate most — claims,
; releases, realizations, archives. Note the typed identity keys:
; |intent[311] is the INTEGER 311; |intent["0042"] is the STRING "0042"
; (a legacy import that kept its zero-padded id). The path scenarios use
; that contrast deliberately.

